@startuml
title exact-orb — BuildNatal: отмена после начала commit

' Целевой cancellation contract ApplicationOrchestrator R3.2.
' Проверяемый порядок важнее конкретной asyncio-реализации.

autonumber
hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
    NoteFontColor #334155
}

box "TRANSPORT" #DBEAFE
    boundary "Request task" as Request
end box

box "APPLICATION" #FFEDD5
    control "ApplicationOrchestrator" as Orch
    control "Commit task\n(strong reference)" as CommitTask
    collections "Structured Log" as Log
end box

box "SESSION" #D1FAE5
    control "ContextService" as Context
    database "SessionPersistence" as Store
end box

Request -> Orch : execute(command, session_id, run)
Orch -> Log : INFO application_operation_started
Orch -> Orch : routing → load → BuildNatalSuccess
Orch -> Log : DEBUG application_stage_finished\nstage=load
Orch -> Log : DEBUG application_stage_finished\nstage=handler

Orch -> CommitTask : create protected commit stage
activate CommitTask
CommitTask -> Context : save(session_id, original expected, delta)
Context -> Store : compare_and_set(...)

Request -[#C62828]-> Orch : cancel request task
Orch -> Orch : remember cancellation;\ncontinue waiting for CommitTask

alt commit подтверждён
    Store --> Context : committed state_version
    Context --> CommitTask : Committed(state_version)
    CommitTask --> Orch : ApplicationCommitted
    Orch -> Log : DEBUG application_commit_attempt_finished\nattempt=1, outcome=committed
else commit не подтверждён
    Store -[#C62828]-> Context : unavailable
    Context --> CommitTask : StateCommitFailed(error_code)
    note over Orch, CommitTask
    Отмена уже наблюдалась, поэтому
    вторая попытка commit не начинается.
    end note
    CommitTask --> Orch : ApplicationStateCommitFailure
    Orch -> Log : WARNING application_commit_attempt_finished\nattempt=1, outcome=state_commit_failed
end
deactivate CommitTask

Orch -> Log : INFO/WARNING application_operation_finished\nterminal_kind=result\ndelivery_cancelled=true
Orch -[#C62828]-> Request : raise original CancelledError

note over Orch, CommitTask
asyncio.shield защищает inner task от отмены,
но внешний await всё равно получает CancelledError.
Поэтому Orchestrator сохраняет task и явно
дожидается её результата до terminal event.
Повторная отмена не оставляет task без ожидания.
end note

@enduml
